criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Adult patients with confirmed solid organ or haematological malignancy;
* Adults aged 18 years or older;
* Planned to receive anthracycline chemotherapy; or prior to the start of the second cycle of anthracycline chemotherapy for those who required an urgent start to their chemotherapy for clinical reasons;
* Provision of written informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Expected lifespan of under one year;
* Not expected to complete the planned course of chemotherapy.
